  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using the property&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sinx</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>sinx</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>sinx</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;{as given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cosx</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
